	<title>
		Program Flow Analysis for Reducing and Estimating the Cost of Test Coverage Criteria
							| SADIO Electronic Journal of Informatics and Operations Research
			</title>

	
<link rel="icon" href="https://revistas.unlp.edu.ar/public/journals/67/favicon_es_ES.png">
